      <h1 id="build-config-openshift-io-v1" class="group scroll-mt-20">Build [config.openshift.io/v1]<a href="#build-config-openshift-io-v1" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>Build configures the behavior of OpenShift builds for the entire cluster. This includes default settings that can be overridden in BuildConfig objects, and overrides which are applied to all builds.</p>
      <p>The canonical name is "cluster"</p>
      <p>Compatibility level 1: Stable within a major release for a minimum of 12 months or 3 minor releases (whichever is longer).</p>
      </dd>
