      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>defaultProxy contains the default proxy settings for all build operations, including image pull/push and source download.</p>
      <p>Values can be overrode by setting the <code>HTTP_PROXY</code>, <code>HTTPS_PROXY</code>, and <code>NO_PROXY</code> environment variables in the build config’s strategy.</p>
      </dd>
