      <TableHead>Type</TableHead>
      <TableHead>Description</TableHead>
      </TableRow>
      </TableHeader>
      <TableBody>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>httpProxy</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>httpProxy is the URL of the proxy for HTTP requests.  Empty means unset and will not result in an env var.</TableCell>
